{"v":"1","t":"Namo tassa Bhagavato Arahato Sammāsambuddhassa."},
{"v":"2","t":"Aṭṭhārasa dhātuyo—cakkhudhātu, sotadhātu, ghānadhātu, jivhādhātu, kāyadhātu, rūpadhātu, saddadhātu, gandhadhātu, rasadhātu, phoṭṭhabbadhātu, cakkhuviññāṇadhātu, sotaviññāṇadhātu, ghānaviññāṇadhātu, jivhāviññāṇadhātu, kāyaviññāṇadhātu, manodhātu, manoviññāṇadhātu, dhammadhātu."},
